        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1695_6205.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>: nachbarlich willig dienst, und was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebß</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetß</unclear> vermoegendt zuvor. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>, fürsichtige, ehr-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">same</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyse</unclear>, insonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>, und getrüwe liebe nach-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">baurn</unclear>. Unß hat unser landtman M. <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Küekhaimer</unclear></persName>
<lb n="5"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">küpfferschmidt</unclear> fürbringen lassen, wie das er ain zeit hero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwrigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtwerkh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebräüchlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gearbaitet</unclear>, und aber
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iezt</unclear>, von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> kupfferschmiden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwrer</unclear> statt solichs ihme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewehrt</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>; Weil er aber ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aarmer</unclear> man, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begere</unclear> sine <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">klaine</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>kinder, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züerhalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wäre</unclear> sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthänig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/>das wir ihme unser intercession an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erthäylen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölten</unclear>.
<lb n="11"/>Wan dan wir ihme, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> ainem ehrlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtwerchßmann</unclear>, so
<lb n="12"/>nit allain das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtwerch</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwrer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelehrnet</unclear>, sonder auch
<lb n="13"/>ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thäyl</unclear> seiner, wie auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrowen</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>verwandten und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">by</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hat</unclear>, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear> gern
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürdersam</unclear> sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölten</unclear>. So gelangt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>:
<lb n="16"/>nachbarliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear>, ihr wöllen ihne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtmann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstiklich</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbefolchen</unclear> haben, und da er sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> loblichen ordnungen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwrer</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>statt gemäß verhaltet, seine sachen in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwre</unclear> statt lassen ver-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khauffen</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwrigen</unclear>, so es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>, sin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">arbäyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> ver-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bieten</unclear>; und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> bißhero <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füro</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stohn</unclear>, damit er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aarme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinder</unclear> desto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">baßter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernehren</unclear>, und
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zemahl</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> genossen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zhaben</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gespüren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khönne</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/>das sind wir umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwren</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölcher</unclear> nachbar-
<lb n="24"/>lichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">correspondenz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebeschulden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derzeit</unclear> guetwillig. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unß</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samptlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">göttlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewaren</unclear> wolbefelchende.
<lb n="26"/>Datum. <origDate when="1610-06-28" resp="#ner">28. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">juny</unclear>. a° 1610</origDate>.
<lb n="27"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-513" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stathalter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> rath
<lb n="28"/>zue Appenzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1695_6206.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1695_6207.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1695_6208.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="29"/>Den frommen, fuersichtigen, ersammen unnd
<lb n="30"/>weysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeistern und Raath der Statt
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sankt</unclear> Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ynsonders</unclear> gueten fründen
<lb n="32"/>und getrüwen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachburen</unclear>.
</p>
